WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.280
"Settle down, class," said the teacher.

2
00:00:12.281 --> 00:00:14.768
"Summer vacation is coming soon.

3
00:00:14.769 --> 00:00:18.556
Today I want you to write about what you will do."

4
00:00:18.557 --> 00:00:22.016
This assignment is easy!

5
00:00:22.017 --> 00:00:26.249
I will write about going to my grandparents' house.

6
00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:30.461
They live up north beside a large lake.

7
00:00:30.462 --> 00:00:34.911
The lake is so clear that I can see right to the bottom.

8
00:00:34.912 --> 00:00:41.165
Early in the morning, my grandfather and I will go fishing on his boat.

9
00:00:41.166 --> 00:00:46.890
If we are lucky, we will catch a big fish.

10
00:00:46.891 --> 00:00:50.758
It is very quiet and peaceful on the lake.

11
00:00:50.759 --> 00:00:54.462
After lunch we will do many chores.

12
00:00:54.463 --> 00:00:58.377
I like helping my grandfather mow the lawn.

13
00:00:58.378 --> 00:01:03.165
He has a big lawn mower that I can ride.

14
00:01:03.166 --> 00:01:06.049
We will also clean the boat.

15
00:01:06.050 --> 00:01:09.821
My grandfather will check the engine.

16
00:01:09.822 --> 00:01:16.699
I will polish the inside and outside of the boat.

17
00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:20.736
After we do the chores, I will be able to play.

18
00:01:20.737 --> 00:01:25.741
Last year I made a fort high up in a tall tree.

19
00:01:25.742 --> 00:01:29.762
Some friends will come and play in my tree fort.

20
00:01:29.763 --> 00:01:33.778
We will do many fun things together.

21
00:01:33.779 --> 00:01:37.371
My friends and I will also go to the beach.

22
00:01:37.372 --> 00:01:41.546
At the beach we will build a sand castle.

23
00:01:41.547 --> 00:01:46.758
Last year we made one that was almost as tall as I was.

24
00:01:46.759 --> 00:01:50.726
At five o'clock my grandmother will barbecue hamburgers.

25
00:01:50.727 --> 00:01:54.017
We'll also eat corn on the cob.

26
00:01:54.018 --> 00:01:58.334
My grandmother is the best cook in the world!

27
00:01:58.335 --> 00:02:03.001
After dinner my grandparents and I will watch the sunset.

28
00:02:03.002 --> 00:02:09.546
The sun looks very beautiful as it sets over the lake.

29
00:02:09.547 --> 00:02:13.890
At night we will sit around a fire pit.

30
00:02:13.891 --> 00:02:18.858
My grandfather will tell me stories.

31
00:02:18.859 --> 00:02:22.969
Sometimes we roast marshmallows for s'mores.

32
00:02:22.970 --> 00:02:26.683
Soon I will get tired, and it will be time for bed.

33
00:02:26.684 --> 00:02:29.159
But I don't mind going to bed.

34
00:02:29.160 --> 00:02:33.476
I will be able to do everything again the very next day.

35
00:02:33.477 --> 00:02:40.270
I really love—

36
00:02:40.271 --> 00:02:45.656
"Time's up!" said the teacher. "Please hand in your stories."

37
00:02:45.657 --> 00:02:50.913
Oh no! I haven't started writing yet!

